static const char __pyx_k_Transcription_Tools_Module_Prov[] = "\nTranscription Tools Module\n\nProvides speech-to-text transcription with three providers:\n\n  - **local** (default, free) \342\200\224 faster-whisper running locally, no API key needed.\n    Auto-downloads the model (~150 MB for ``base``) on first use.\n  - **groq** (free tier) \342\200\224 Groq Whisper API, requires ``GROQ_API_KEY``.\n  - **openai** (paid) \342\200\224 OpenAI Whisper API, requires ``VOICE_TOOLS_OPENAI_KEY``.\n\nUsed by the messaging gateway to automatically transcribe voice messages\nsent by users on Telegram, Discord, WhatsApp, Slack, and Signal.\n\nSupported input formats: mp3, mp4, mpeg, mpga, m4a, wav, webm, ogg, aac\n\nUsage::\n\n    from tools.transcription_tools import transcribe_audio\n\n    result = transcribe_audio(\"/path/to/audio.ogg\")\n    if result[\"success\"]:\n        print(result[\"transcript\"])\n";
